    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Welcome to GoreBox</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into the adrenaline-fueled world of GoreBox, an action-packed sandbox game that harmoniously fuses relentless action with unlimited creativity. Here, you're equipped with an extensive array of weapons and explosives, as well as a special piece of equipment that stands out from the rest: the Reality Crusher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027330/extras/d9bcdb6cd5defe792bceb0df428e6be0.avif?t=1734826638\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Reality Crusher: Your Ultimate Tool</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Reality Crusher is a unique tool that enables you to spawn, manipulate, and obliterate any spawnable entity in the game. With this tool, you are the architect of your own chaotic adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027330/extras/24633f88944150187e7d5a5ad0670f4e.avif?t=1734826638\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Interactions and Gameplay Settings</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a player, you share the same damage system as the active, physics-based ragdolls in the game. This shared damage system makes every encounter thrilling, as you balance between creating chaos and protecting yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027330/extras/824bab22514ea51543df249e05b9b87c.avif?t=1734826638\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You also have control over various gameplay settings. Whether it's activating invincibility, turning on noclip, or switching to creator mode (which grants you access to the Reality Crusher), you can tailor the game to your playstyle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027330/extras/893729c4bae1de438b3fa4a0ee2ea41f.avif?t=1734826638\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Map Editor and Workshop</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With GoreBox's built-in map editor, you're not limited to just playing in the game world - you can create it. Construct custom maps and decorate them with your choice of textures. Then, share your creations through the game's built-in workshop and explore maps from other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027330/extras/5540e7245d5babb8d707e4da94a0765c.avif?t=1734826638\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Express Yourself!</strong><br><br>In <i>GoreBox</i>, you can personalize your character with a wide range of customizable skins, armor, and unique accessories like hats and masks. Even the GoreDolls can be styled to your liking, letting you tailor both your character and the world around you to reflect your chaotic vision</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027330/extras/1923af96eed9cbf6d452acf2a45c87b0.avif?t=1734826638\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Role-Play, Chat, and Trading</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in <i>GoreBox</i>'s dynamic world with an extensive range of emotes, text and voice chat system. Customize your character with unique skins, clothing, armor, and hats, or go ragdoll at will. Trade items effortlessly using in-game currency, but be careful\u2014death comes with a cost, as you\u2019ll drop a portion of your money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027330/extras/b64caa5d66d88f1ba223133f17ef69a4.avif?t=1734826638\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cross-platform Play</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One of the unique features of GoreBox is its cross-platform compatibility. Whether you're flying helicopters, orchestrating battles between NPCs, or simply exploring the world with friends, the fun never stops - no matter if you're on Mobile or PC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027330/extras/f86811e505cfabe329125804734e2ae7.avif?t=1734826638\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The limits are only bound by your imagination. So, what are you waiting for? <br>Don't forget though, In GoreBox, time won't be the only thing you're killing!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Welcome to GoreBox</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into the adrenaline-fueled world of GoreBox, an action-packed sandbox game that harmoniously fuses relentless action with unlimited creativity. Here, you're equipped with an extensive array of weapons and explosives, as well as a special piece of equipment that stands out from the rest: the Reality Crusher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027330/extras/d9bcdb6cd5defe792bceb0df428e6be0.avif?t=1734826638\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Reality Crusher: Your Ultimate Tool</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Reality Crusher is a unique tool that enables you to spawn, manipulate, and obliterate any spawnable entity in the game. With this tool, you are the architect of your own chaotic adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027330/extras/24633f88944150187e7d5a5ad0670f4e.avif?t=1734826638\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Interactions and Gameplay Settings</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a player, you share the same damage system as the active, physics-based ragdolls in the game. This shared damage system makes every encounter thrilling, as you balance between creating chaos and protecting yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027330/extras/824bab22514ea51543df249e05b9b87c.avif?t=1734826638\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You also have control over various gameplay settings. Whether it's activating invincibility, turning on noclip, or switching to creator mode (which grants you access to the Reality Crusher), you can tailor the game to your playstyle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027330/extras/893729c4bae1de438b3fa4a0ee2ea41f.avif?t=1734826638\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Map Editor and Workshop</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With GoreBox's built-in map editor, you're not limited to just playing in the game world - you can create it. Construct custom maps and decorate them with your choice of textures. Then, share your creations through the game's built-in workshop and explore maps from other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027330/extras/5540e7245d5babb8d707e4da94a0765c.avif?t=1734826638\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Express Yourself!</strong><br><br>In <i>GoreBox</i>, you can personalize your character with a wide range of customizable skins, armor, and unique accessories like hats and masks. Even the GoreDolls can be styled to your liking, letting you tailor both your character and the world around you to reflect your chaotic vision</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027330/extras/1923af96eed9cbf6d452acf2a45c87b0.avif?t=1734826638\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Role-Play, Chat, and Trading</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in <i>GoreBox</i>'s dynamic world with an extensive range of emotes, text and voice chat system. Customize your character with unique skins, clothing, armor, and hats, or go ragdoll at will. Trade items effortlessly using in-game currency, but be careful\u2014death comes with a cost, as you\u2019ll drop a portion of your money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027330/extras/b64caa5d66d88f1ba223133f17ef69a4.avif?t=1734826638\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cross-platform Play</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One of the unique features of GoreBox is its cross-platform compatibility. Whether you're flying helicopters, orchestrating battles between NPCs, or simply exploring the world with friends, the fun never stops - no matter if you're on Mobile or PC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027330/extras/f86811e505cfabe329125804734e2ae7.avif?t=1734826638\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The limits are only bound by your imagination. So, what are you waiting for? <br>Don't forget though, In GoreBox, time won't be the only thing you're killing!</p>",
    "short_description": "GoreBox is a chaotic physics-driven sandbox where creativity meets destruction. Use the Reality Crusher to spawn, manipulate, and obliterate anything. Customize, battle with friends, roleplay, or face devious creatures. In this world, your imagination rules\u2014and chaos is your playground!",
